_🧹 Nitpick_ | _🔵 Trivial_

**Validate URL scheme before opening external links.**

`window.open` with arbitrary URLs could be exploited if notification data is compromised. Validate that the URL uses `http:` or `https:` protocol.



```diff
   const handleClick = () => {
     onMarkAsRead();
-    if (notification.notification?.action_url) {
-      window.open(notification.notification.action_url, '_blank');
+    const actionUrl = notification.notification?.action_url;
+    if (actionUrl) {
+      try {
+        const url = new URL(actionUrl);
+        if (url.protocol === 'http:' || url.protocol === 'https:') {
+          window.open(actionUrl, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer');
+        }
+      } catch {
+        // Invalid URL, ignore
+      }
     }
   };
```

Also adds `noopener,noreferrer` to prevent tab-nabbing attacks.

